{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t法國政府將部署法軍反恐力量的士兵，應對本周六可能出現的暴力場面，並考慮禁止未經申報、或已申報但存在失控風險的示威遊行。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n而在意大利，當局決定向米蘭增派500名軍人協助警方維持治安，持續至今年年底。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:59:51.252536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:49:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:38:13.952341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:41.803086+00:00","content_hash":"cae74efcd216180621224dd4f79c65c4daf9f1089508cf1b9dfa5294536c7b20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}